      "price": {
        "price": 299.95,
        "currency": "USD",
        "compare_at_price": null
      },
      "description": "The JOOLA Kosmos Pro V introduces a new hybrid shape. It blends the reach of the Perseus with the expanded sweet spot of the Scorpeus. This design creates a balanced option for players. Drive from the baseline or counter at the kitchen with ease and smooth transitions. The JOOLA Kosmos Pro V uses Kinetic Frame technology. It flexes to store swing momentum and releases it instantly on impact. This frame absorbs energy from incoming balls. It helps you dictate the pace and responds quickly without punishing imperfect contact. Facilitate confident shot placement in fast exchanges. This paddle supports players who demand precision and consistency in every match. Master Your Game with the JOOLA Kosmos Pro V The 16mm model marks Federico Staksrud’s first signature paddle. Its thick core provides the dwell time needed to slow the game down. Fed uses this stability to control the ball through transitions. It is the perfect tool for executing a strategic, calculated approach. The 14mm version is Tyson McGuffin's newest signature paddle. It delivers the added pop and quick response he relies on for fast-paced play. Tyson’s aggressive style benefits from this aerodynamic build. It allows for lightning-fast resets and powerful put-away shots at the net. Choosing your gear is like selecting software. Just as a creator relies on logic pro, a pickleball pro relies on the right paddle. Precision is key for any professional workflow. JOOLA Kosmos optimizes your court performance. Select Fed's 16mm paddle for more weight (8.1oz) and a wider grip (4.250in). It offers maximum control for patient, defensive players. Choose Tyson's 14mm paddle for less weight (7.9oz) and a slimmer grip (4.125in). This setup favors speed and aggressive offensive maneuvers. This hybrid shape ensures you are ready for elite competition. It offers the best of both power and forgiveness for every player level. Experience the synergy of two legendary shapes. Whether you prioritize reach or a massive sweet spot, this series delivers the results.Invest in your growth on the court. This signature series provides the professional-grade materials required to elevate your skill level. Your Pro V order includes a protective box with free overgrips and edge tape and a 12-month warranty. More delivery info here.",
