        "compare_at_price": 249.99
      },
      "description": "Where Limits End, the Future Begins The new Paddletek Honeyfoam™ core combines three advanced foam types into a unified structure, creating a softer and more responsive feel at impact. The multi-foam design increases dwell time for improved control, expands the sweet spot for more consistent performance, and delivers long-term durability. This is a core engineered for players who demand precision, power, and reliability in every rally. Note about 14 mm: The Honeyfoam™ TKO-X 14 mm was engineered to push performance beyond conventional limits. Approved for professional and amateur UPA competition, it exceeded the power threshold required for USAP-sanctioned events. As a result, a special “UPA Approved” sticker has been applied over the original embossed USAP mark. The performance hasn't changed—and neither has the intent behind Honeyfoam™.",
